     "=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20______________________________________=\r<br>__________\r<br>\r<br>=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20RESEARCH=20UNIT=20FOR=20WILDLIFE=20POP=\r<br>ULATION=20ASSESSMENT\r<br>=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=\r<br>=20=20=20ANNOUNCEMENT\r<br>=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20NEW=20SOFTW=\r<br>ARE=20-=20DISTANCE=205.0\r<br>=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20______________________________________=\r<br>__________\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>Distance=205.0=20Beta=204=20(the=20first=20public=20beta)=20is=20now=20ava=\r<br>ilable=20for=20download=20\r<br>via=20the=20world-wide=20web.\r<br>\r<br>The=20web=20site=20address=20for=20download=20is:\r<br>\r<br><a href=\"http://www.ruwpa.st-and.ac.uk/distance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.ruwpa.st-and.ac.uk/distance/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479324715000&amp;usg=AOvVaw21CeNmZxNSI3GlrDzSuEMq\">http://www.ruwpa.st-and.ac.uk/distance/</a>\r<br>\r<br>Distance=205.0=20is=20a=20major=20update=20over=20the=20previous=20version=\r<br>=20(4.1).=20=20The=20major=20\r<br>new=20feature=20is=20the=20addition=20of=20a=20new=20analysis=20engine,=20=\r<br>mark-recapture=20\r<br>distance=20sampling=20(MRDS)=20-=20allowing=20the=20analysis=20of=20double=\r<br>-observer=20line=20\r<br>transect=20data.=20=20This=20is=20implemented=20via=20a=20link=20to=20the=20=\r<br>free=20statistics=20\r<br>software=20R.=20=20There=20are=20a=20number=20of=20other=20more=20minor=20=\r<br>enhancements,=20and=20a=20\r<br>rather=20improved=20manual=20with=20more=20sample=20projects.=20=20A=20ful=\r<br>l=20list=20of=20new=20\r<br>features=20and=20resolved=20problems=20is=20given=20at=20the=20end=20of=20=\r<br>this=20message.\r<br>\r<br>Although=20the=20current=20release=20is=20a=20beta,=20it=20is=20really=20o=\r<br>nly=20the=20MRDS=20part=20of=20\r<br>the=20software=20that=20is=20still=20under=20test.=20=20We=20expect=20the=20=\r<br>CDS=20and=20MCDS=20engines,=20\r<br>as=20well=20as=20the=20survey=20design=20engine=20to=20work=20as=20well=20=\r<br>as,=20or=20better=20than,=20\r<br>those=20in=20Distance=204.1.=20=20We=20are=20planning=20some=20additional=20=\r<br>new=20features=20for=20the=20\r<br>full=20release=20of=20Distance=205.0,=20but=20these=20will=20be=20in=20add=\r<br>ition=20to=20current=20\r<br>features.\r<br>\r<br>Distance=205.0=20will=20happily=20co-exist=20with=20versions=204.1=20and=20=\r<br>earlier=20-=20although=20\r<br>users=20wishing=20to=20continue=20using=20the=20previous=20versions=20shou=\r<br>ld=20consult=20the=20\r<br>ReadMe.rtf=20file=20that=20comes=20with=20the=20setup=20program=20for=20de=\r<br>tails=20before=20\r<br>installing=20the=20new=20version.\r<br>\r<br>We=20hope=20you=20enjoy=20using=20the=20new=20software,=20and=20look=20for=\r<br>ward=20to=20any=20feedback=20\r<br>we=20can=20use=20to=20improve=20it.=20=20Our=20thanks=20to=20everyone=20wh=\r<br>o=20used=20contributed=20\r<br>suggestions=20and=20reported=20problems=20with=20previous=20versions.\r<br>\r<br>=20-=20Len=20Thomas\r<br>=20=20=20Distance=20development=20project=20co-ordinator\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>Distance=205.0=20Beta=204=20-=208=20April=202005\r<br>-------------------\r<br>\r<br>New=20Features/Upgrades\r<br>\r<br>&quot;=09CDS/MCDS:=20When=20bootstrapping,=20progress=20in=20percent=20is=20sho=\r<br>wn=20in=20the=20\r<br>interface.\r<br>&quot;=09CDS/MCDS:=20When=20bootstrapping,=20the=20bootstrap=20point=20estimate=\r<br>s=20are=20now=20\r<br>the=20mean=20of=20the=20estimates=20for=20each=20bootstrap=20replicate.=20=\r<br>=20(Previously=20used=20\r<br>reported=20just=20the=20original,=20non-bootstrap=20point=20estimate.)=20=20=\r<br>Bootstrap=20CVs=20\r<br>are=20bootstrap=20SE/bootstrap=20point=20estimate.=20(Previously=20were=20=\r<br>bootstrap=20\r<br>SE/original=20point=20estimate.)\r<br>&quot;=09CDS/MCDS:=20When=20bootstrapping,=20if=20errors=20occur=20in=20some=20=\r<br>bootstrap=20\r<br>replicates=20such=20that=20density=20and=20other=20statistics=20cannot=20b=\r<br>e=20obtained=20from=20\r<br>those=20runs,=20Distance=20now=20reports=20the=20number=20of=20runs=20wher=\r<br>e=20the=20bootstrap=20\r<br>failed.\r<br>&quot;=09See=20also=20previous=20beta=20versions,=20below.\r<br>\r<br>Resolved=20Problems\r<br>\r<br>Installation\r<br>&quot;=09{281}=20New=20version=20of=20Tab=20control=20used=20in=20Distance=205=20=\r<br>causes=20a=20run=20time=20\r<br>error=20when=20closing=20Distance=204:=20error=2091,=20=1Cobject=20variabl=\r<br>e=20or=20with=20block=20\r<br>variable=20not=20set=1D.=20This=20can=20safely=20be=20ignored!\r<br>&quot;=09{297}=20After=20double-clicking=20on=20the=20Distance=20setup=20progra=\r<br>m,=20the=20setup=20\r<br>program=20for=20another=20package=20(e.g.,=20Mark)=20may=20start=20up.=20=20=\r<br>Solution:=20Make=20sure=20\r<br>there=20are=20no=20other=20setup=20programs=20in=20the=20same=20directory=20=\r<br>as=20Distance.=20[Shane=20\r<br>Wellendorf=2011=20Aug=2004;=20Fixed=20LJT=2011=20Aug=2004=20=13=20renamed=20=\r<br>the=20setup=20program=20from=20\r<br>setup.exe=20to=20somethng=20that=19s=20likely=20to=20be=20unique]\r<br>Interface\r<br>&quot;=09{306}=20General=20-=20opening=20projects.=20=20Under=20some=20regional=\r<br>=20operating=20\r<br>systems,=20double-clicking=20on=20a=20Distance=20project=20to=20open=20it=20=\r<br>cased=20an=20error=2013=20\r<br>-=20unknown=20type.=20[Atanga=20Ekobo=20Aug=202004,=20Fixed=20LJT=202=20Fe=\r<br>b=202005]\r<br>&quot;=09{300}=20Manual:=20Need=20to=20describe=20how=20to=20do=20smearing=20=13=\r<br>=20in=20data=20filter=20\r<br>you=20need=20to=20set=20automatic=20equal=20intervals,=20as=20choosing=20t=\r<br>he=20intervals=20\r<br>manually=20doesn=19t=20use=20the=20NCLASS=20command=20in=20the=20analysis=20=\r<br>engine.=20=20Also=20point=20\r<br>out=20that=20smearing=20not=20supported=20for=20MCDS.=20[LJT=2027=20Oct=20=\r<br>2004]\r<br>&quot;=09{134