s=20Engine\r<br>&quot;=09{217}=20Smearing=20has=20not=20been=20tested=20for=20the=20MCDS=20engi=\r<br>ne=20=13=20it=20may=20\r<br>produce=20incorrect=20results.=20=20In=20any=20case,=20qq-plots=20for=20MC=\r<br>DS=20analyses=20with=20\r<br>smearing=20have=20been=20disabled,=20as=20they=20don=19t=20make=20sense=20=\r<br>when=20there=20are=20non-\r<br>integer=20numbers=20of=20observations.=20=20[LJT:=203=20Feb=2003.=20=20Dis=\r<br>abled=20smearing=20\r<br>interface=20for=20MCDS=20analyses,=20and=20added=20a=20note=20to=20the=20m=\r<br>anual,=20LJT=201=20Jan=2005]\r<br>&quot;=09{305}=20When=20fitting=20detection=20function=20at=20a=20higher=20leve=\r<br>l=20and=20\r<br>estimating=20at=20a=20lower=20one=20(e.g.,=20fit=20globally,=20estimate=20=\r<br>by=20stratum)=20and=20\r<br>doing=20a=20bootstrap,=20get=20the=20inappropriate=20warning=20message=20*=\r<br>*=20Bootstrap=20\r<br>Warning:=20Degrees=20of=20freedom=20less=20than=201.0=20for=20estimating=20=\r<br>confidence=20limits=20\r<br>on=20density.=20=20Confidence=20limits=20not=20calculated.=20**.=20=20This=\r<br>=20message=20should=20not=20\r<br>appear,=20since=20bootstrapping=20is=20the=20correct=20way=20to=20obtain=20=\r<br>variance=20estimates=20\r<br>in=20this=20situation.=20=20[Tiago=20Marques=208=20Dec=202004;=20Fixed=20L=\r<br>JT=206=20Jan=202005]\r<br>&quot;=09{308}=20Same=20as=20305,=20but=20message=20also=20appears=20when=20clu=\r<br>ster=20size=20is=20a=20\r<br>covariate=20[Tiago=20Marques,=2017=20Feb=202005;=20Fixed=20LJT=2017=20Feb=20=\r<br>2005]\r<br>&quot;=09{307}=20When=20bootstrapping,=20with=20cluster=20size=20as=20a=20covar=\r<br>iate,=20can=20get=20\r<br>=1CInternal=20error=2050,=20mismatched=20strata=1D=20errors,=20and=20simil=\r<br>ar.=20=20Problem=20is=20\r<br>caused=20by=20Distance=20trying=20to=20report=20expected=20cluster=20size=20=\r<br>during=20bootstrap,=20\r<br>when=20this=20is=20not=20estimated=20when=20cluster=20size=20is=20a=20cova=\r<br>riate.=20=20[Tiago=20Marques=20\r<br>Jan=202005;=20Fixed=20LJT=20Feb=202005]\r<br>&quot;=09{309}=20When=20the=20data=20structure=20is=20complex,=20with=20multipl=\r<br>e=20substratum=20or=20\r<br>subsample=20layers=20and=20there=20are=20covariates,=20can=20encounter=20a=\r<br>n=20error=20=1CError:=20\r<br>Encountered=20a=20problem=20while=20executing=20the=20data=20creating=20qu=\r<br>ery=1D.=20[Dirk=20\r<br>Burhans,=202=20March=202005;=20Fixed=20LJT=203=20March=203005]\r<br>\r<br>Distance=205.0=20Beta=203=20-=206=20January=202005=20(and=20earlier=20beta=\r<br>s)\r<br>-------------------\r<br>\r<br>New=20Features/Upgrades\r<br>\r<br>&quot;=09MRDS=20Analysis=20engine\r<br>&quot;=09CDS/MCDS:=20When=20using=20multipliers,=20can=20now=20include=20degree=\r<br>s=20of=20freedom=20\r<br>used=20to=20the=20=20multiplier=20SE=20(including=20cue=20rate),=20and=20t=\r<br>hese=20are=20taken=20into=20\r<br>account=20when=20calculating=20the=20degrees=20of=20freedom=20for=20the=20=\r<br>density=20estimate=20\r<br>(using=20the=20Satterthwaite=20formula=20=13=203.75=20in=20Introduction=20=\r<br>to=20Distance=20\r<br>Sampling).=20=20When=20degrees=20of=20freedom=20are=20not=20specified,=20t=\r<br>hey=20are=20assumed=20to=20\r<br>be=20infinity.=20=20Note=20that=20the=20calculated=20dfs=20(and=20therefor=\r<br>e=20confidence=20limits)=20\r<br>will=20be=20different=20in=20this=20version=20of=20Distance=20to=20previou=\r<br>s=20versions=20as=20\r<br>Distance=20previously=20ignored=20multipliers=20when=20calculating=20the=20=\r<br>df=20(see=20known=20\r<br>problem=20256,=20now=20fixed).\r<br>&quot;=09CDS/MCDS:=20Added=20number=20of=20observations=20to=20list=20of=20colu=\r<br>mns=20available=20\r<br>in=20the=20Analysis=20Browser.=20=20Number=20of=20observations,=20number=20=\r<br>of=20samples=20and=20\r<br>total=20effort=20are=20now=20also=20summed=20over=20samples/strata.\r<br>&quot;=09CDS/MCDS:=20Extended=20the=20number=20of=20columns=20in=20the=20stats=20=\r<br>file,=20to=20\r<br>accommodate=20very=20large=20number=20of=20strata=2